    "title": "The Shortest Fun Run in Whatcom County Is Back: The Wander To Wander 1K - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By LocalTalk Contributor ,\n9 hours ago The Whatcom Dispute Resolution Center invites the community to join us for a fun run that is more fun than run on Saturday, June 6. This Bellingham-based race benefits the Whatcom Dispute Resolution Center and is hosted by Wander Brewing. Beginning with donuts at the WDRC office, participants will ‘wander’ (or run) along the 0.62-mile-long route to Wander Brewing. At the finish line, enjoy a pint of beer or root beer (included with all registrations), a food truck, raffle prizes, and the fanfare of this exciting, friendly competition, all while raising funds to advance our mission to provide and promote constructive and collaborative approaches to conflict. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
